24: - NEVER open static text data files (`src/data/protocolData.ts`, `src/data/bioscienceData.ts`, `src/data/roadmapStepsData.ts`, `src/data/seedTrackingData.ts`) unless the user prompt explicitly asks to modify them.
25: - Keep edits minimal and surgical. NEVER rewrite an entire large file when a targeted search/replace block suffices.
26: - **Zero Functionality Loss — Demote, Don't Stack (UI Discipline)**: Preserve 100% of domain logic, calculators, state hooks, and instructional content, but demote secondary explanations into `<details>`, never stack duplicate navigation bars, use `@theme` tokens (`bg-paper`, `bg-surface`, `text-ink`, `text-ink-soft`, `border-line`, `bg-wine`, `text-danger`), and never use `text-[10px]`, `font-black`, or emojis in `.tsx` files.
27: 
28: ## 3. Silent Verification Loop (Mandatory)
29: - After completing edits, DO NOT run verbose `npm run build` or `npm test`.
30: - Always verify changes by running: `npm run agent:check`
31: - If `npm run agent:check` passes, update `.agent/TASK_STATE.md` if requested and stop immediately.
</file>

